# Local ops stand-up

Run once per day on hub + workers:

- [ ] `cd Portable-agents && ./scripts/studex-local-ops-up.sh --start-hermes-gateway`
- [ ] `scripts/agent-fleet-check.sh paperclip $PAPERCLIP_URL`
- [ ] `herdr` → workspace studex-ops → pane: `hermes doctor`
- [ ] Paperclip UI: Hermes Lead heartbeat policy ok

## AutoMeat (Mac Mini only)

- [ ] `export AUTOMEAT_ENV_FILE=...` and `AUTOMEAT_REGISTER_JSON=...` (local paths)
- [ ] `./scripts/studex-local-ops-up.sh --automeat-check`
- [ ] Obsidian herdr/automeat.md **continuous** or one step at a time